asts", "tr": "atar", "fr": "lance", "id": "melontarkan", "ur": "ڈالتا ہے", "bn": "নিক্ষেপ করেন", "fa": "می‌افکند"}}, {"text": "بِٱلْحَقِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَّٰمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْغُيُوبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "34:53", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3659.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "When they disbelieved in it of yore. They aim at the unseen from afar off.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Halbuki daha önce (dünyada) O'nu inkâr etmişlerdi. Uzak yerden gayba taş atıyorlardı.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ پہلے تو اس سے کفر کرچکے تھے، اور بے دیکھے پھینک مارتے ہیں دور مکان سے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan sesungguhnya mereka telah mengingkari Allah sebelum itu; dan mereka menduga-duga tentang yang ghaib dari tempat yang jauh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَبْلُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَقْذِفُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a850835a660de64a48f7.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and they throw", "bs": "i bacaju", "tr": "ve atarlar", "fr": "et ils jettent", "id": "dan mereka melempar", "ur": "اور وہ پھینکے جاتے ہیں", "bn": "এবং তারা নিক্ষেপ করে", "fa": "و می‌اندازند"}}, {"text": "بِٱلْغَيْبِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّكَانٍۭ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَعِيدٍ", "